            "description": "Production Planned Quantity Deviation Analyst is responsible to answer planned deviations which highlights differences between the recipe and production batch planned quantities. Also it understand user query and answers question by calling relevent REST service available in the tool. Also appends dynamic filter to the REST call without any syntax errors.",
